                  "fill": "$foreground",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The official ticket resale window opens on 1 March 2026. If your plans have changed, this is how you release your ticket to another burner — and how you find one if you're still looking.",
