                  "name": "Para",
                  "fill": "$foreground",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The official ticket resale window opens on 1 March 2026. If your plans have changed, this is how you release your ticket to another burner — and how you find one if you're still looking.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-brand",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ts2lk",
                  "name": "Para",
                  "fill": "$foreground",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Quicket is the only official resale channel. Tickets are transferred through Quicket's own system so the barcode stays valid at the gate. AfrikaBurn does not sell, resell, or transfer tickets directly — and we will never DM you a ticket link.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-brand",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "T1q30K",
                  "name": "Para",
                  "fill": "$foreground",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Watch for scams. If someone offers a ticket over social media or asks for an EFT outside Quicket, treat it as fraud. When in doubt, come back here — real notices only ever come from AfrikaBurn.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-brand",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
