                  "fill": "$foreground",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A record, not monitoring. It is here so that if a burner ever asks who saw their medical information there is an honest answer, and so a real incident can be reconstructed. Nothing on this page can refuse or delay a read — the row is written after the notes are shown, because an emergency must never wait on a log write. There are no volume thresholds and no alerting: working through every member of a camp before the burn is what the job looks like.",
                  "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
                  "fontSize": 12.5,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                }
