                            },
                            "ovNIW": {
                              "content": "I build slow-burn kinetic sculpture and run a tiny 3am tea lounge for wanderers who can’t sleep. Third-culture kid, welder by trade, happiest in the quiet hours after the loud ones have burnt out. I’ve come to the Karoo since 2019 — for the dust, the silence, and the strangers who become family by Thursday. New here? Find me, I’ll make you tea and point you at the best art. Ask me about the stars, or safe ways to weld in the wind."
