                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "fPKrx",
                          "name": "Body",
                          "fill": "$muted-foreground",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "We're a tea-party camp of 18 on the Binnekring. Expect mismatched china, a 17:00 tea service every day and a lot of dust. Everything you need before you pack is on this page.",
